#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:5
#: efb7e0983f104ac2b826802d0ce03891
msgid "Setting up SITL on Linux"
msgstr "在 Linux 上设置 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:7
#: daa203ed0ebb4ec39dac598dd28a05ee
msgid ""
"This page describes how to setup the :ref:`SITL (Software In The Loop) "
"<sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` on Linux. The specific commands were "
"tested on Ubuntu from 12.10 to 18.04."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何在 Linux 上设置 :ref:`SITL（软件在环）<sitl-simulator-software-in-the-"
"loop>`。所列具体命令已在 Ubuntu 12.10 至 18.04 上测试通过。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:11
#: f7142ab8adb44cabbe67639df85fd5fd
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:13
#: a709433839ff4fbb88c97d27929484c3
msgid ""
"The SITL simulator allows you to run Plane, Copter or Rover without any "
"hardware. It is a build of the autopilot code using an ordinary C++ "
"compiler, giving you a native executable that allows you to test the "
"behaviour of the code without hardware."
msgstr ""
"SITL 仿真器允许您在无需任何硬件的情况下运行 Plane、Copter 或 Rover。它使用普通的 C++ "
"编译器对飞控代码进行构建，生成本地可执行文件，让您无需硬件即可测试代码的行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:18
#: 41149db409ca465ab37a94b659e6a955
msgid ""
"SITL runs natively on Linux and Windows. See the separate :ref:`windows "
"installation page <sitl-native-on-windows>` for a windows install."
msgstr ""
"SITL 可以在 Linux 和 Windows 上原生运行。Windows 安装请参阅 :ref:`Windows 安装页面 <sitl-"
"native-on-windows>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:25
#: 2c02d52d07c047dca7e44a429ce603bb
msgid "Install steps"
msgstr "安装步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:27
#: 8079ab80d4c347138e973ead02f5981f
msgid ""
"Please follow the instructions in :ref:`Setting up the Build Environment "
"(Linux/Ubuntu) <building-setup-linux>` to set up the full environment, "
"including SITL."
msgstr ""
"请按照 :ref:`设置构建环境（Linux/Ubuntu）<building-setup-linux>` 中的说明设置完整环境，包括 SITL。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:30
#: 376ea0b1e7a44a308055fe8f54993bb1
msgid "Start SITL simulator"
msgstr "启动 SITL 仿真器"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:32
#: 9a6f4682598e4dbfba53cdc87f00af16
msgid ""
"To start the simulator first change directory to the vehicle directory. For "
"examples below, for the Multicopter code change to **ardupilot/ArduCopter**:"
msgstr "要启动仿真器，首先切换到对应飞行器的目录。例如，对于多旋翼代码，切换到 **ardupilot/ArduCopter**："

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:41
#: 65b2708a8d9f47a795a12a1e3895550f
msgid ""
"Then start the simulator using **sim_vehicle.py**. The first time you run "
"it, you should use the ``-w`` option to wipe the virtual EEPROM of user "
"changed parameters and load the default parameters for your vehicle."
msgstr ""
"然后使用 **sim_vehicle.py** 启动仿真器。第一次运行时，建议使用 ``-w`` 选项擦除虚拟 EEPROM "
"中用户修改的参数，并加载您飞行器的默认参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:49
#: 7cd1ed1cb6d94baf81a7ab6ed1efd93f
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if not starting in the ArduCopter directory, but at the base "
"**ardupilot** directory:"
msgstr "或者，如果不是从 ArduCopter 目录启动，而是从 **ardupilot** 根目录启动："

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:58
#: c4703137adf644619f8f95398e6ffca7
msgid ""
"`sim_vehicle.py "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/sim_vehicle.py>`__"
" has many useful options, ranging from setting the simulation speed through "
"to choosing the initial vehicle location. These can be listed by calling it "
"with the ``-h`` flag (and some are demonstrated in :ref:`Using SITL for "
"ArduPilot Testing <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>`)."
msgstr ""
"`sim_vehicle.py "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/sim_vehicle.py>`__"
" 具有许多有用的选项，包括设置仿真速度以及选择飞行器初始位置等。可以通过 ``-h`` 标志查看这些选项（部分选项在 :ref:`使用 SITL 进行 "
"ArduPilot 测试 <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>` 中有演示）。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:65
#: 17579000ed89425eb2a3bcabbae5951b
msgid ""
"If the map tiles don't load, you can temporarily change the map provider in "
"the map window by clicking View/Service. To keep the new map service between"
" launches, add the following lines to the end of your \".bashrc\" (change "
"MicrosoftHyb to the provider you want):"
msgstr ""
"如果地图瓦片无法加载，您可以在地图窗口中单击「视图/服务」临时更改地图提供商。若要在重启之间保留新的地图服务，请将以下行添加到您的「.bashrc」末尾（将"
" MicrosoftHyb 替换为您想要的提供商）："

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:74
#: cec8840832114f28b104e4813d161c68
msgid "Learn MAVProxy"
msgstr "学习 MAVProxy"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:76
#: c11b1f2373ac4b84bfe96e934b926b4d
msgid ""
"To get the most out of SITL you really need to learn to use MAVProxy. Have a"
" read of the :ref:`MAVProxy documentation <mavproxy:home>`. Enjoy flying!"
msgstr ""
"要充分发挥 SITL 的潜力，您确实需要学习使用 MAVProxy。请阅读 :ref:`MAVProxy 文档 "
"<mavproxy:home>`。祝您飞行愉快！"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:80
#: 4f8778205c854dbdb283744c3b51d6e3
msgid "Updating MAVProxy and pymavlink"
msgstr "更新 MAVProxy 和 pymavlink"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:82
#: 4b290d82a5ff4991a52a485aa4340548
msgid ""
"New versions of MAVProxy and pymavlink are released quite regularly. If you "
"are a regular SITL user you should update every now and again using this "
"command"
msgstr "MAVProxy 和 pymavlink 的新版本发布相当频繁。如果您是 SITL 的常规用户，应该定期使用以下命令进行更新："

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:92
#: 740be82986b74c4e90938fe45c544e0e
msgid "FlightGear 3D View (Optional)"
msgstr "FlightGear 三维视图（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:94
#: 2b664ebab5a54a8983812b0b9aad3e84
msgid ""
"Developers can optionally install the `FlightGear Flight Simulator "
"<http://www.flightgear.org/>`__ and use it (in view-only mode) to display a "
"3D simulation of the vehicle and its surroundings. This provides a much "
"better visualization than the 2D maps and HUD flight displays provided by "
"*MAVProxy* and *Mission Planner*."
msgstr ""
"开发者可以选择安装 `FlightGear 飞行仿真器 <http://www.flightgear.org/>`__ "
"并以（仅视图模式）显示飞行器及其周围环境的三维仿真。这比 *MAVProxy* 和 *Mission Planner* 提供的二维地图和 HUD "
"飞行显示提供了更好的可视化效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:102
#: e1c7d8c0889b4e4d8767cdcfb4b4dbb9
msgid "FlightGear:Simulated Copter at KSFO (click for larger view)."
msgstr "FlightGear：在 KSFO 仿真的多旋翼飞行器（点击查看大图）。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:104
#: 1cb88a3f2d424ab7b53f1303455515cb
msgid ""
"SITL outputs *FlightGear* compatible state information on UDP port 5503. We "
"highly recommend you start *FlightGear* before starting SITL (although this "
"is not a requirement, it has been found to improve stability in some "
"systems)."
msgstr ""
"SITL 通过 UDP 端口 5503 输出与 *FlightGear* 兼容的状态信息。我们强烈建议在启动 SITL 之前先启动 "
"*FlightGear*（虽然这不是必需的，但在某些系统上已发现这样做能提高稳定性）。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:109
#: 6bc41e53c8ed4603af838806f95d3c69
msgid "The main steps (tested on Ubuntu Linux 14.04 LTS) are:"
msgstr "主要步骤（已在 Ubuntu Linux 14.04 LTS 上测试）如下："

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:111
#: 5f5eefc675524ffe8554e3b735b6ab80
msgid "Install FlightGear from the terminal:"
msgstr "从终端安装 FlightGear："

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:117
#: 43675504c37444b2aef2203985d9bfd7
msgid ""
"Open a new command prompt and run the appropriate shell file for your "
"vehicle in **/ardupilot/Tools/autotest/**: `fg_plane_view.sh "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/fg_plane_view.sh>`__"
" (Plane) and `fg_quad_view.sh "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/fg_quad_view.sh>`__"
" (Copter)."
msgstr ""
"打开新的命令提示符，在 **/ardupilot/Tools/autotest/** 中运行适合您飞行器的 shell "
"文件：`fg_plane_view.sh "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/fg_plane_view.sh>`__"
" （固定翼）和 `fg_quad_view.sh "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/fg_quad_view.sh>`__"
" （多旋翼）。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:124
#: c231678170fb4f1e8420753787e88fd8
msgid "This will start *FlightGear*."
msgstr "这将启动 *FlightGear*。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:126
#: 0496d794f76943ef89684b48b5b6f46a
msgid ""
"Start SITL in the terminal in the normal way. In this case we're specifying "
"the start location as San Francisco airport (KSFO) as this is an interesting"
" airport with lots to see:"
msgstr "在终端以正常方式启动 SITL。此处我们将起始位置指定为旧金山机场（KSFO），这是一个有很多可看内容的有趣机场："

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:134
#: c74f42e70f0941cbb4027d051cd72a36
msgid ""
"If *FlightGear* is running on a different host, for instance if you are "
"running Windows WSL, you can pass in the IP of the machine running "
"*FlightGear*:"
msgstr ""
"如果 *FlightGear* 运行在不同的主机上，例如您正在使用 Windows WSL，可以传入运行 *FlightGear* 的机器的 IP "
"地址："

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:142
#: 6e51a5a0782147b2a1b2ec46bb161f2b
msgid ""
"*FlightGear* will always initially start by loading scenery at KSFO (this is"
" hard-coded into the batch file) but will switch to the scenery for the "
"simulated location once SITL is started."
msgstr ""
"*FlightGear* 启动时总是先加载 KSFO 的场景（这在批处理文件中是硬编码的），但一旦 SITL 启动，将切换到仿真位置的场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:148
#: 3bf7f7e2439d4d77a493a20c8f07548f
msgid "If the vehicle appear to be hovering in space (no"
msgstr "如果飞行器看起来悬浮在空中（没有"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:149
#: 4607c94d51d7435e929a02314824fade
msgid ""
"scenery) then *FlightGear* does not have any scenery files for the selected "
"location. Choose a new location!"
msgstr "地景），则 *FlightGear* 没有所选位置的场景文件。请选择一个新位置！"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:152
#: aad5d55ad29344c39f35f5d62ec1d2a0
msgid ""
"You can now takeoff and fly the vehicle as normal for :ref:`Copter <copter-"
"sitl-mavproxy-tutorial>` or :ref:`Plane <plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial>`, "
"observing the vehicle movement including pitch, yaw and roll."
msgstr ""
"您现在可以按照 :ref:`Copter <copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial>` 或 :ref:`Plane <plane-"
"sitlmavproxy-tutorial>` 的正常方式起飞并飞行，观察飞行器的运动，包括俯仰、偏航和横滚。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:158
#: 05f15e30701c43a1ab81fde44f48a121
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-linux.rst:160
#: 1c5be035a99042f39a21bb32d8e61b83
msgid ""
"After installation, see :ref:`Using SITL for ArduPilot Testing <using-sitl-"
"for-ardupilot-testing>` for guidance on flying and testing with SITL."
msgstr ""
"安装完成后，请参阅 :ref:`使用 SITL 进行 ArduPilot 测试 <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing>`，获取使用 SITL 飞行和测试的指导。"
